ty, with many PC and console gamers sharing their opinions on social media platforms. Some agreed with Pachter, arguing that there is a sense of elitism among PC gamers, while others defended the PC gaming community, highlighting the benefits of playing on a computer over a console. The ongoing discussion shed light on the differences and similarities between the two gaming camps, sparking a healthy conversation about the hobby they all love.", "allsat": false, "losses": [1.708984375, 0.008091880939900875], "weighted_loss": 1.789903163909912, "edited": true}]}
